MoonlightCore it's a Minecraft library mod for multi-loader mods, providing multiple loader API abstractions.




 Using MoonlightCore as a player
Install it, and if you have any mod that depends on this mod, it will do its work ^^

 Using MoonlightCore to develop mods
Add the following to your build.gradle :

 gradle
repositories {
 maven {
 url = "https://realbleom.codeberg.page/maven-repository/"
 }
}

dependencies {
 // Replace ${moonlightcoreVersion} with the version you are want to use 
 // Common/Xplat: implementation "de.leoxian.moonlightcore:moonlightcore-xplat:${moonlightcoreVersion}"
