 DynamX allows you to create vehicles,&nbsp;cars and props with a large set of properties to fully customize your objects . You can also create items, blocks and armors, or spawn ragdolls . 
 Everything can be easily created with content packs. Thanks to DynamX's OBJ Model Loader , every object you create can be provided with very detailled OBJ models. 
